    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78951" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρατρέφω</span></b> , aor. 1
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρέθρεψα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
				</span></i>
			 (v. infr.) :—
				Pass.
			, aor. 2
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρετράφην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					866
				</span></i>
			 :—<i>feed beside</i> or <i>with</i> one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν βουλόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Timocl.
					9.2
				</span></i>
			; <i>maintain in addition</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				62.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				6.571.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππους,
			κύνας</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.830c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				3.1
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			) :—
				Pass.
			, of slaves, etc., <i>to be brought up with</i> the
			children, <i><span class="en">
				Posidon.
				36
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόθωνας ; οὐχ αὑτῷ
					παρετράφην ἀλλά σοι</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Men.
			</span></i> l. c.; of concubines, <i>live with</i> the wives, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Art.</u>
				27
			</span></i>; of men and animals, <i>feed at another's expense</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.200
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				244
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.13c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bring up alike</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφοτέρους ἴσους ἐκ παίδων παραθρέψαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					3.15.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be educated</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν φιλοσοφία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.37e
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				138c
			</span></i>.</div>
